e annonce, appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Allez \u00e0 l'exercice \u00e9crit</span>.</span></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/><br/><span class=\"strong\">Ma petite annonce</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Activity 3", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Vous avez fini !", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Quand on \u00e9crit une petite annonce, on doit inclure : <ul><li>Les mots descriptifs qui sont utilis\u00e9s pour pr\u00e9senter votre appartement </li> <li> Renseignements sur le lieu</li> <li> Abr\u00e9viations pour certains mots </li></ul>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Corrigez votre petite annonce.</br>  Lisez-la \u00e0 voix haute \u00e0 un camarade ou \u00e0 un membre de votre famille.<br><br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Appuyez sur le bouton <span class=\"strong\">Soumettre </span> pour sauvegarder votre travail.</span>", "type": "text"}]}, {"grading_contents": {"header": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 5, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}, {"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}, {"content": "", "colspan": 1, "content_type": "text", "element": "th"}]}]}, "body": {"rows": [{"cells": [{"content": "", "colspan": 1, "conten